756
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:19,800
as you may be new users

757
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:23,240
or these terms may be difficult for you to understand.

758
00:39:23,240 --> 00:39:25,160
If you have any difficulty understanding

759
00:39:25,160 --> 00:39:26,920
